From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mind_one
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mindone: react to the flip-camera module's hall switch (P131/F4296)

Automatically switch the active CameraX selector between the front and back
logical camera when org.mindone.keyhandler.CameraFlipKeyHandler reports that
the flip-camera module's hall switch changed position, both at startup (from
the Settings.System position left by the last flip) and live while the app is
running (via a signature-permission-gated broadcast). The manual flip button
keeps working unchanged.

Also pins Aperture's signing certificate to "platform" so it shares a
certificate with the device tree's key handler component and is granted the
signature-level permission gating the broadcast.

See CAMERA-FLIP-PLAN-1309 (mind_one project) for the full design and
the device-tree side of this feature.

Change-Id: I131f4296000000000000000000000000000mind1
---
diff --git a/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml b/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
